Subject: [PATCH] Verification: scrolling Appearance harness, lyrics scroll
 reachability, artwork-backed player shot

- AppearanceMatrixTest: host Column gains verticalScroll to match the production
  settings sheet (SettingsSheet.kt:502); fillMaxHeight cards then wrap content
  as shipped. Checker source fixed to 800dp height (fillMaxSize collapses under
  unbounded constraints). Equal-card weight(1f) intent untouched.
- LyricsSourcesDialogScrollTest (new): swipes the capped sources list and
  asserts the last row enters the viewport fully; Reset/Done stay put.
- PlayerArtworkShotTest (new): real checker artwork through the production
  Coil path, Blur on vs off; asserts the artwork band is real (not the
  placeholder) and pixel-identical across the switch (backdrop is
  unconditional; overlay frost gate is covered by PlayerFrostGateTest).
- V6ScreenshotTest.PlayerShot: optional artworkUrl param (default null, all
  existing captures unchanged).
